25
00:04:06,161 --> 00:04:08,797
¿Y renunciaremos a todo por un auto?

26
00:04:10,933 --> 00:04:12,601
No es sólo un auto.

27
00:04:13,168 --> 00:04:15,270
Es el auto de John Wick.

28
00:04:17,239 --> 00:04:18,307
Oh.

29
00:04:19,074 --> 00:04:20,776
(CERRADURA ZUMBA)

30
00:04:23,946 --> 00:04:25,047
