33
00:04:31,487 --> 00:04:32,521
(SORPRENDIDO) Oh.

34
00:04:32,721 --> 00:04:33,789
A mi hermano.

35
00:04:35,758 --> 00:04:37,526
A una docena de mis hombres.

36
00:04:39,828 --> 00:04:41,530
Sólo por ese auto.

37
00:04:43,532 --> 00:04:44,566
